<title>AUSTRALIA: Bendigo Bank issues A$10 mln capital notes.</title>
<headline>Bendigo Bank issues A$10 mln capital notes.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Regional Bank Bendigo Bank Ltd said on Friday it had successfully issued of A$10 million of subordinated capital notes on June 30.</p>
<p>The notes have a final maturity data of June 30, 2007 and pay interest quarterly. The issue was arranged by SBC Warburg Australia, the bank said.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
